Provenance
----------

This skill (`nuke-review`) is a fork of `thermo-nuclear-code-quality-review` from the
`cursor-team-kit` plugin in https://github.com/cursor/plugins, upstream commit
6e3d2ea56d7d446b955eaae6ac4c8eef8bf504cf (2026-05-28). The standards, thresholds,
finding order and approval bar are Cursor's. The restructuring for agents (procedure with
completion criteria, standards table, positive wording) and the name are by Guillaume
Mongin (@hellraisercenobit); these modifications are Copyright (c) 2026 Guillaume Mongin
and released under the same MIT License. This skill is excluded from the "original works"
statement in the repository root NOTICE.
